823
01:31:26,481 --> 01:31:27,815
You can't just...

824
01:31:27,816 --> 01:31:28,901
cut yourself open.

825
01:31:30,485 --> 01:31:32,653
Elective surgery
would be months away.

826
01:31:32,654 --> 01:31:35,156
There's no way
that I can last that long.

827
01:31:35,157 --> 01:31:36,699
Hana...

828
01:31:36,700 --> 01:31:38,284
Hana, no!

829
01:31:38,285 --> 01:31:39,535
No! This is...

830
01:31:39,536 --> 01:31:41,412
This is not cool!

831
01:31:41,413 --> 01:31:43,789
OK? You cannot put this on me.

832
01:31:43,790 --> 01:31:45,666
I swear I will make you pay

833
01:31:45,667 --> 01:31:48,002
for, like,
20 years' worth of therapy!

834
01:31:48,003 --> 01:31:51,173
Fucking decades of it, Hana!

835
01:31:52,299 --> 01:31:54,050
Look, I'll... I'll do
all the work.

836
01:31:54,051 --> 01:31:57,470
All you have to do is make sure
that I don't bleed out after.

837
01:31:57,471 --> 01:31:59,096
What? Hana...

838
01:31:59,097 --> 01:32:00,306
Hana!

839
01:32:00,307 --> 01:32:01,808
Hana...

840
01:32:08,357 --> 01:32:10,066
Hana? What are you doing?

841
01:32:11,151 --> 01:32:13,152
Lowering my blood sugar.

842
01:32:13,153 --> 01:32:14,487
What?

843
01:33:47,581 --> 01:33:48,706
Argh!

844
01:34:14,024 --> 01:34:15,233
Oh!

845
01:36:57,646 --> 01:36:59,730
oh!

846
01:37:22,712 --> 01:37:24,714
Argh!

847
01:37:35,392 --> 01:37:36,642
Ohh.

848
01:39:01,311 --> 01:39:02,771
Hey!

849
01:39:03,730 --> 01:39:06,148
God, you stupid fucking idiot.

850
01:39:06,149 --> 01:39:07,609
What the hell were you thinking?

851
01:39:09,861 --> 01:39:13,073
Hey! Hey. Hey. Hey.

852
01:39:14,032 --> 01:39:15,575
I'm gonna get you out of here.

853
01:40:02,122 --> 01:40:04,373
I told you to wear
the other shirt.

854
01:40:04,374 --> 01:40:06,376
This one gets wrinkled
so easily.

855
01:40:07,752 --> 01:40:10,629
You said this one
brings out my eyes, though.

856
01:40:10,630 --> 01:40:12,005
I never said that.

857
01:40:12,006 --> 01:40:13,674
You didn't?

858
01:40:13,675 --> 01:40:15,217
Must've been my other wife.

859
01:40:15,218 --> 01:40:17,052
You are ridiculous.

860
01:40:18,888 --> 01:40:21,141
Hana!
You are going to be late!

861
01:40:25,478 --> 01:40:28,814
Today, we gather
to honour the silent teachers

862
01:40:28,815 --> 01:40:31,734
who have profoundly shaped our
understanding of the human body

863
01:40:31,735 --> 01:40:33,318
and the art of medicine.

864
01:40:33,319 --> 01:40:35,821
Each donor was a person

865
01:40:35,822 --> 01:40:39,616
with dreams, fears
and stories of their own.

866
01:40:39,617 --> 01:40:41,869
We do not know all the details
of their lives,

867
01:40:41,870 --> 01:40:43,328
but we do know this.

868
01:40:43,329 --> 01:40:44,788
In their final act,

869
01:40:44,789 --> 01:40:47,249
they chose to
become our teachers.

870
01:40:47,250 --> 01:40:49,126
They chose to leave a legacy

871
01:40:49,127 --> 01:40:52,212
of learning,
compassion and healing.

872
01:40:52,213 --> 01:40:55,549
To the families of our donors
here with us today...

873
01:41:32,253 --> 01:41:33,670
Hey.

874
01:41:33,671 --> 01:41:35,048
Hi.

875
01:41:38,009 --> 01:41:39,302
Come on in.

876
01:41:44,390 --> 01:41:45,766
What's all this?

877
01:41:45,767 --> 01:41:48,560
Oh, these are for you

878
01:41:48,561 --> 01:41:50,438
to replace what I...

879
01:41:51,397 --> 01:41:52,689
last time.

880
01:41:52,690 --> 01:41:54,858
- You really didn't have to.
- Right. Sorry.

881
01:41:54,859 --> 01:41:57,569
Um... I couldn't remember
everything you had,

882
01:41:57,570 --> 01:41:59,655
so I just went off of
the program list.

883
01:41:59,656 --> 01:42:01,406
But, um, if there's anything
missing, I can just...

884
01:42:01,407 --> 01:42:04,201
- Hana, I don't need groceries.
- Sorry.

885
01:42:04,202 --> 01:42:05,703
You said.

886
01:42:14,254 --> 01:42:16,130
I'm sorry for disappearing.

887
01:42:17,090 --> 01:42:19,133
I was a little screwy, evidently.

888
01:42:20,134 --> 01:42:22,554
But I really am trying.

889
01:42:40,238 --> 01:42:42,782
What were you doing
at the gym before exams?

890
01:42:45,285 --> 01:42:46,995
I wasn't at the gym.

891
01:42:48,413 --> 01:42:50,122
I saw you go into
the locker room.

892
01:42:50,123 --> 01:42:51,791
I called you, like, right after.

893
01:43:07,765 --> 01:43:09,766
I should probably
leave you to it.

894
01:43:09,767 --> 01:43:13,021
Hana... come on.

895
01:43:15,565 --> 01:43:17,400
I want to understand.

896
01:43:39,547 --> 01:43:41,299
You're wonderful.

897
01:43:49,390 --> 01:43:50,850
Adorable.

898
01:43:55,605 --> 01:43:57,023
Clever.

899
01:43:59,943 --> 01:44:02,111
Completely amazing.

900
01:44:06,866 --> 01:44:08,409
What's wrong?

